#: ../../source/reference/pybroker.model.rst:2 da63a2b8a70a458fbbbe8078de12d4a5
msgid "pybroker.model module"
msgstr "pybroker.model 模块"

#: f7c2e734742b480aae9dd31fdc0e771c of pybroker.model:1
msgid "Contains model related functionality."
msgstr "包含与模型相关的功能。"

#: 3a86749f3b8a4a6b80f0870b632a948d of pybroker.model.CachedModel:1
msgid "Stores cached model data."
msgstr "存储已缓存的模型数据。"

#: 9235e8e989c541c6984dfc2c6d505524 of pybroker.model.CachedModel:5
msgid ""
"Names of the columns to be used as input for the model when making "
"predictions."
msgstr "进行预测时用作模型输入的列名称。"

#: 57523d27676149bf9614ec930381f8bc 794445a5b5d04de7a43754d9f663eacd of
#: pybroker.model.CachedModel
msgid "type"
msgstr "类型"

#: 921a6456265a491784bf91c124a28d0c of pybroker.model.CachedModel:8
msgid "tuple[str] | None"
msgstr "tuple[str] | None"

#: d3610d226baa4b389263b9c238311a1f of pybroker.model.CachedModel:12
msgid ""
"Names of the columns that lag features were built from at training time, "
"in feature block order. ``None`` when the model was not trained with "
"``lags``, and when loading a model cached before this field existed."
msgstr ""
"训练时用于构建滞后特征的列名称，按特征块顺序排列。如果模型未使用 ``lags`` 训练，或加载的是本字段出现之前缓存的模型，则为 "
"``None``。"

#: e86e6d97c67441deb66fbcbfe67d4a74 of pybroker.model.CachedModel:17
msgid "tuple[str, ...] | None"
msgstr "tuple[str, ...] | None"

#: c10d53da9b50453697048e591380ed30 of pybroker.model.CachedModel.model:1
msgid "Trained model instance."
msgstr "已训练模型实例。"

#: db12f2ea3ee14ebe96162d0e3f7b60ea of pybroker.model.IntervalBoundModel:1
msgid ""
"A :class:`.ModelSource` bound to one or more compression intervals, "
"returned by :meth:`ModelSource.intervals` and passed to the ``models`` "
"parameter of :meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution`."
msgstr ""
"绑定到一个或多个压缩区间的 :class:`.ModelSource`，由 :meth:`ModelSource.intervals` "
"返回，并传递给 :meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution` 的 ``models`` 参数。"

#: cec3069bb14a465a9bd0d711ad148893 of
#: pybroker.model.IntervalBoundModel.intervals:1
msgid ""
"Normalized :class:`~pybroker.interval.TimeframeInterval`\\ s the model is"
" trained on. May include the literal ``'base'`` for the base timeframe."
msgstr ""
"该模型据以训练的规范化 :class:`~pybroker.interval.TimeframeInterval`\\。可能包含字面量 "
"``'base'`` 表示基础时间框架。"

#: 0df311ff7b2d451295800d614e78cf26 of
#: pybroker.model.IntervalBoundModel.source:1
msgid "The bound :class:`.ModelSource`."
msgstr "已绑定的 :class:`.ModelSource`。"

#: 24cd794d27904ec380de39c583fd73f0 of pybroker.model.LagSeriesKey:1
msgid "Internal cache key for a full-history lagged series."
msgstr "完整历史滞后序列的内部缓存键。"

#: d97503f0674d47cf8721b0a4e07d113d of pybroker.model.ModelInput:1
msgid "Internal numpy-backed model input with optional lag feature metadata."
msgstr "内部的、numpy 支持的模型输入，带有可选的滞后特征元数据。"

#: 721eaec6f2334883807a3990cce8836f of pybroker.model.ModelInput:3
msgid ""
"Not part of the public API. User-facing code receives "
":class:`pandas.DataFrame` instances materialized via "
":meth:`to_dataframe`, with any lag feature matrix passed explicitly as a "
"separate :class:`numpy.ndarray` argument."
msgstr ""
"不属于公共 API。面向用户的代码会收到通过 :meth:`to_dataframe` 具体化的 "
":class:`pandas.DataFrame` 实例，任何滞后特征矩阵都会作为单独的 :class:`numpy.ndarray` "
"参数显式传递。"

#: 16472458e4d94387b5b6697d1e3d81d6 of
#: pybroker.model.ModelInput.drop_lag_warmup:1
msgid "Drops the leading rows whose lag features are not yet defined."
msgstr "丢弃滞后特征尚未定义的前导行。"

#: 70c4ac5fe54545cdb7d8a59518a2c4b8 of
#: pybroker.model.ModelInput.drop_lag_warmup:3
msgid ""
"Only each symbol's warmup region is trimmed. Dropping every row with a "
"NaN lag feature would also remove rows from the middle of the series "
"whenever a lag column is sparse -- an event column registered with "
":func:`pybroker.scope.register_columns` is NaN except on the bars it "
"fires, and an all-NaN ``volume`` column is routine for index, FX and CFD "
"series. Either silently shrinks the training set, or empties it."
msgstr ""
"仅裁剪每个品种自身的预热区间。若丢弃所有存在 NaN 滞后特征的行，每当滞后列稀疏时，也会一并移除序列中间的行 —— 通过 "
":func:`pybroker.scope.register_columns` 注册的事件列，除了触发的那些 K 线外都是 "
"NaN，而对于指数、外汇和 CFD 序列，全 NaN 的 ``volume`` 列也是常见情况。这样做要么会悄然缩小训练集，要么会将其清空。"

#: b0daf63f88114059a5c04367284854b7 of
#: pybroker.model.ModelInput.drop_lag_warmup:10
msgid ""
"Pooled input stacks one block per symbol, so each block carries its own "
"warmup at its own offset. Trimming only the front of the matrix would "
"leave every block after the first with its NaN rows intact, which "
"``sklearn.fit`` rejects outright."
msgstr ""
"池化（pooled）输入按每个品种堆叠一个数据块，因此每个数据块都在各自的偏移处带有自己的预热期。仅裁剪矩阵前端，会使第一个数据块之后的每个数据块仍保留其"
" NaN 行，而这会被 ``sklearn.fit`` 直接拒绝。"

#: a53bb1d4c8e44f3798b141f402193a08 of
#: pybroker.model.ModelInput.lag_warmup_len:1
msgid "Returns how many leading rows have undefined lag features."
msgstr "返回有多少前导行的滞后特征未定义。"

#: 0cb8a55e1cdc4e8381b92002619fe344 of
#: pybroker.model.ModelInput.lag_warmup_len:3
msgid ""
"These rows cannot be handed to an estimator: sklearn rejects NaN "
"outright, and a NaN-tolerant predict_fn quietly produces a prediction "
"from features that do not exist yet."
msgstr ""
"这些行不能交给估计器：sklearn 会直接拒绝 NaN，而一个能容忍 NaN 的 predict_fn "
"则会悄悄地根据尚不存在的特征生成一个预测结果。"

#: 24d4ab8f00e2439b975cb3d859576188 of
#: pybroker.model.ModelInput.select_columns:1
msgid "Returns a view restricted to ``columns``."
msgstr "返回一个限定在 ``columns`` 范围内的视图。"

#: 34666a62f6c448abafb6fb6f4f99a82c of pybroker.model.ModelInput.slice:1
msgid "Returns a row slice sharing backing array memory."
msgstr "返回一个共享底层数组内存的行切片。"

#: ea218ab3597c4adb807d9e2d46d0d637 of pybroker.model.ModelInput.slice_range:1
msgid "Returns a row range sharing backing array memory."
msgstr "返回一个共享底层数组内存的行范围。"

#: 90c6b60eeabd4b80b4d491290643d879 of pybroker.model.ModelInput.to_dataframe:1
msgid "Materializes a DataFrame of the input columns."
msgstr "将输入列具体化为一个 DataFrame。"

#: a15f679f995246e7b1661f19068d2470 of pybroker.model.ModelLoader:1
msgid "Loads a pre-trained model."
msgstr "加载一个预训练模型。"

#: ../../source/reference/pybroker.model.rst 0fe4ceafd12e41238fc3de5446078e55
#: 256732941ba24da1acef22e5c054065f 4abd77e373c84a39806577980aabb9c5
#: 5e5a2fcd92ab44f0a769ef2dfa0b6204 619f5e91b08549b79b2c25ad3012676d
#: 67118fdba4364e838c948aed29fdeee4 b7ef8aa7e74142a281f7d634eca24592
#: c3315155b2584ed9b091d8cd473ed931 c87a52ae308e493ba521b7422832fdb4
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: 27ceaac1396848e8808f46eea5f34047 53685221ed994d7481b5727c1a044e52
#: 9b6bfbc3d66f4fb9885ff299bfea9d20 of pybroker.model.ModelLoader:3
#: pybroker.model.ModelSource:4 pybroker.model.ModelTrainer:3
msgid "Name of model."
msgstr "模型名称。"

#: 9352e78d3ff4410daadf549e64bed536 of pybroker.model.ModelLoader:4
msgid ""
"``Callable[[symbol: str, train_start_date: datetime, train_end_date: "
"datetime, ...], DataFrame]`` used to load and return a pre-trained model."
" This is expected to return either a trained model instance, or a tuple "
"containing a trained model instance and a :class:`Iterable` of column "
"names to to be used as input for the model when making predictions."
msgstr ""
"用于加载并返回预训练模型的 ``Callable[[symbol: str, train_start_date: datetime, "
"train_end_date: datetime, ...], "
"DataFrame]``。该函数应返回一个已训练的模型实例，或一个元组，其中包含已训练的模型实例，以及进行预测时用作模型输入的列名称 "
":class:`Iterable`。"

#: 662b28ee4a574216a41ba01e605f1763 a8449dece40a496ba9e9a2dc3b7b5bad
#: be0f020c528e412999469149971dfa97 of pybroker.model.ModelLoader:10
#: pybroker.model.ModelSource:5 pybroker.model.ModelTrainer:16
msgid ""
":class:`Iterable` of names of :class:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator`\\ s "
"used as features of the model."
msgstr "用作该模型特征的 :class:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator`\\ 名称的 :class:`Iterable`。"

#: 3d535c690ba54cc684f45cff352aa332 3f0928722c85448dbe00c19c796502ae
#: ff49ad2f4de444abbe08e82c48b42e77 of pybroker.model.ModelLoader:13
#: pybroker.model.ModelSource:8 pybroker.model.ModelTrainer:19
msgid ""
"``Callable[[DataFrame], DataFrame]`` for preprocessing input data passed "
"to the model when making predictions. If set, ``input_data_fn`` will be "
"called with a :class:`pandas.DataFrame` containing all test data."
msgstr ""
"用于预处理进行预测时传递给模型的输入数据的 ``Callable[[DataFrame], "
"DataFrame]``。如果设置了该值，``input_data_fn`` 会以包含全部测试数据的 "
":class:`pandas.DataFrame` 被调用。"

#: 04ecd94019e9434fa157e53c16e27754 75dfca94778544ecbc53a164f5c206e1
#: f8287443f7c14c1bbcf42e9aae4f4cd7 of pybroker.model.ModelLoader:17
#: pybroker.model.ModelSource:12 pybroker.model.ModelTrainer:23
msgid ""
"``Callable[[Model, DataFrame], ndarray]`` that overrides calling the "
"model's default ``predict`` function. If set, ``predict_fn`` will be "
"called with the trained model and a :class:`pandas.DataFrame` containing "
"all test data. When ``lags`` is set, it is instead called with the lag "
"feature matrix (:class:`numpy.ndarray`) in place of the DataFrame."
msgstr ""
"用于覆盖调用模型默认 ``predict`` 函数的 ``Callable[[Model, DataFrame], "
"ndarray]``。如果设置了该值，``predict_fn`` 会以已训练的模型和包含全部测试数据的 "
":class:`pandas.DataFrame` 被调用。当设置了 ``lags`` "
"时，调用时会改为传入滞后特征矩阵（:class:`numpy.ndarray`）而不是 DataFrame。"

#: 10f1445dddb342b1bcc6d823d64aa0f9 80493ff87fbd4627b5383ba6ba95bd6f
#: 8a30f6918dd24e709bd6a10c5402baef a8f4ed347a964e5cb8c40350563480a5 of
#: pybroker.model.ModelLoader:23 pybroker.model.ModelSource:28
#: pybroker.model.ModelTrainer:29 pybroker.model.model:87
msgid ""
"If ``True``, the model is trained once per execution using combined "
"multi-symbol data. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr "如果为 ``True``，该模型每次执行会使用合并后的多品种数据训练一次。默认为 ``False``。"

#: 3bfd60759ded4444ab4554cdf37c9d18 of pybroker.model.ModelLoader:25
msgid "``dict`` of kwargs to pass to ``load_fn``."
msgstr "传递给 ``load_fn`` 的关键字参数 ``dict``。"

#: 5a466928c67341c2bc64d2af6d873190 of pybroker.model.ModelLoader.__call__:1
msgid "Loads pre-trained model."
msgstr "加载预训练模型。"

#: a8ba71416100411da95db9a7d1f3b700 of pybroker.model.ModelLoader.__call__:3
msgid "Ticker symbol for loading the pre-trained model."
msgstr "加载预训练模型所用的股票代码。"

#: aae27e8f9e944ffcb607395f3f3b0895 of pybroker.model.ModelLoader.__call__:4
msgid "Start date of training window."
msgstr "训练窗口的起始日期。"

#: ef272c5f08ef4872b7535f64def18dc1 of pybroker.model.ModelLoader.__call__:5
msgid "End date of training window."
msgstr "训练窗口的结束日期。"

#: ../../source/reference/pybroker.model.rst 1cc1fa86c7aa4d07bb00906aef6548be
#: 3cced44c654548f3b3efe2634f708c75 3ed693eced6e476fb79e31930b47f402
#: 8a253fb473ab48a1abb1214028a6f0e0 96394c3a81744876880c28d937ae5b9f
#: cb0ff4cc4bc54a88a1655096960b1b74
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回"

#: f0a235d589714b40a44fcaee282e1fe3 of pybroker.model.ModelLoader.__call__:7
msgid "Pre-trained model."
msgstr "预训练模型。"

#: 61f3d7897ada436ab90545cb53c4ba2d of pybroker.model.ModelSource:1
msgid ""
"Base class of a model source. A model source provides a model instance "
"either by training one or by loading a pre-trained model."
msgstr "模型源的基类。模型源要么通过训练，要么通过加载预训练模型来提供一个模型实例。"

#: 11cff4ef6c6449ecb770011416ff07be of pybroker.model.ModelSource:18
msgid ""
"Number of lagged values to include for each column in ``lag_cols``, "
"producing a ``(n_rows, len(lag_cols) * (lags + 1))`` feature matrix that "
"is passed to ``train_fn`` as ``lag_train``/``lag_test`` and to "
"``predict_fn`` in place of the input DataFrame, rather than added as "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"``lag_cols`` 中每一列要包含的滞后值数量，生成一个形状为 ``(n_rows, len(lag_cols) * (lags + "
"1))`` 的特征矩阵，该矩阵会以 ``lag_train``/``lag_test`` 的形式传递给 ``train_fn``，并替代输入 "
"DataFrame 传递给 ``predict_fn``，而不是作为列添加。"

#: 074fc04e778547ae90e35df2d9af9bdf of pybroker.model.ModelSource:23
msgid ""
"Columns to compute lagged values for. Defaults to the data columns of the"
" training data, excluding ``date`` and ``symbol``; indicators are lagged "
"only when named here."
msgstr "要计算滞后值的列。默认为训练数据的数据列，不包括 ``date`` 和 ``symbol``；只有在此处指定名称的指标才会被计算滞后值。"

#: dfbe893815784912826a50dffc920a3d of pybroker.model.ModelSource:26
msgid ""
"If ``True``, ``predict_fn`` is called once per bar with input truncated "
"to rows up to and including the current bar."
msgstr "如果为 ``True``，``predict_fn`` 会按每根 K 线调用一次，输入会被截断至包含当前 K 线在内的各行。"

#: b9d26f9e396b41ada2b97550714aabef of pybroker.model.ModelSource:30
msgid "``dict`` of additional kwargs."
msgstr "附加关键字参数的 ``dict``。"

#: e4c1c236777a4bac81bec203a0275e9e of pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals:1
msgid ""
"Binds this model to one or more compression intervals for use with "
":meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution`."
msgstr ""
"将此模型绑定到一个或多个压缩区间，以便与 :meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution` "
"搭配使用。"

#: e6eda6b885db475983a9fdeaf2968c0c of pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals:4
msgid ""
"A bound model is trained on exactly the listed intervals' compressed "
"bars, together with any indicators registered on it. Binding replaces the"
" default base-timeframe training; include the literal ``'base'`` in "
"``intervals`` to also train the model on the base timeframe. Per-interval"
" predictions are read with "
":meth:`pybroker.context.IntervalContext.preds`. Bound intervals are "
"automatically made available through "
":meth:`pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval` without also declaring them"
" in the ``intervals`` parameter of "
":meth:`~pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution`::"
msgstr ""
"已绑定的模型只会在所列出的区间的压缩 K 线上训练，连同注册给它的任何指标一起。绑定会替代默认的基础时间框架训练；在 ``intervals`` "
"中包含字面量 ``'base'`` 即可同时在基础时间框架上训练该模型。逐区间的预测结果通过 "
":meth:`pybroker.context.IntervalContext.preds` 读取。绑定的区间会自动通过 "
":meth:`pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval` 提供，无需在 "
":meth:`~pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution` 的 ``intervals`` "
"参数中再次声明它们::"

#: c0f968b81cfc4d3780d9ed5b45a35b48 of pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals:20
msgid ""
"Only trainable models support interval binding. Calling this on a "
"pretrained model (a :class:`.ModelLoader`) raises ``ValueError``."
msgstr "只有可训练的模型才支持区间绑定。对预训练模型（:class:`.ModelLoader`）调用本方法会引发 ``ValueError``。"

#: c7df75b235f14645bcc0fb8d30a05745 of pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals:23
msgid ""
"One or more :class:`~pybroker.interval.TimeframeInterval`\\ s to train "
"this model on, each strictly coarser than the base bar spacing of the "
"backtest data, or the literal ``'base'`` for the base timeframe."
msgstr ""
"训练此模型所使用的一个或多个 "
":class:`~pybroker.interval.TimeframeInterval`\\，每一个都必须严格粗于回测数据的基础 K "
"线间隔，或使用字面量 ``'base'`` 表示基础时间框架。"

#: a001c0994946430b8204f869b55cf69d of pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals:29
msgid ":class:`.IntervalBoundModel` binding this model to ``intervals``."
msgstr "将此模型绑定到 ``intervals`` 的 :class:`.IntervalBoundModel`。"

#: 988274e88d4641c784ff786c68f4472c of
#: pybroker.model.ModelSource.prepare_input_data:1
msgid ""
"Prepares a :class:`pandas.DataFrame` of input data for passing to a model"
" when making predictions. If set, the ``input_data_fn`` is used to "
"preprocess the input data. If ``False``, then indicator columns in ``df``"
" are used as input features."
msgstr ""
"为进行预测时传递给模型准备输入数据的 :class:`pandas.DataFrame`。如果设置了该值，则使用 "
"``input_data_fn`` 对输入数据进行预处理。如果为 ``False``，则使用 ``df`` 中的指标列作为输入特征。"

#: 229cab28e3014ab1a0b52357ebccc5b5 of pybroker.model.ModelTrainer:1
msgid "Trains a model."
msgstr "训练一个模型。"

#: 6c721c7393254884b40f588009cbd24a of pybroker.model.ModelTrainer:4
msgid ""
"When ``pooled`` is ``False``, ``Callable[[symbol: str, train_data: "
"DataFrame, test_data: DataFrame, ...], DataFrame]``. When ``pooled`` is "
"``True``, ``Callable[[symbols: Sequence[str], train_data: DataFrame, "
"test_data: DataFrame, ...], DataFrame]``. When ``lags`` is set, "
"``train_fn`` is additionally called with ``lag_train=`` and ``lag_test=``"
" keyword arguments holding the lag feature matrices aligned one row per "
"``train_data``/``test_data`` row, and must accept both. This is expected "
"to return either a trained model instance, or a tuple containing a "
"trained model instance and a :class:`Iterable` of column names to to be "
"used as input for the model when making predictions."
msgstr ""
"当 ``pooled`` 为 ``False`` 时，为 ``Callable[[symbol: str, train_data: "
"DataFrame, test_data: DataFrame, ...], DataFrame]``。当 ``pooled`` 为 "
"``True`` 时，为 ``Callable[[symbols: Sequence[str], train_data: DataFrame, "
"test_data: DataFrame, ...], DataFrame]``。当设置了 ``lags`` 时，``train_fn`` "
"还会额外接收 ``lag_train=`` 和 ``lag_test=`` 关键字参数，其中包含与 "
"``train_data``/``test_data`` "
"逐行对齐的滞后特征矩阵，且该函数必须同时接受这两个参数。该函数应返回一个已训练的模型实例，或一个元组，其中包含已训练的模型实例，以及进行预测时用作模型输入的列名称"
" :class:`Iterable`。"

#: 2cee24ad01194c9483c1db3929515ce9 of pybroker.model.ModelTrainer:31
msgid "``dict`` of kwargs to pass to ``train_fn``."
msgstr "传递给 ``train_fn`` 的关键字参数 ``dict``。"

#: e440708348a14388a0535d14bf61157c of pybroker.model.ModelTrainer.__call__:1
msgid "Trains model per symbol."
msgstr "按品种训练模型。"

#: 6fa0e337df354cb98585636b1c63c534 of pybroker.model.ModelTrainer.__call__:3
msgid "Ticker symbol of model (models are trained per symbol)."
msgstr "该模型的股票代码（模型按品种训练）。"

#: cad443f104d448d7a518c80bea32b15a of pybroker.model.ModelTrainer.__call__:4
