msgstr ""
"与 ``test_data`` 逐行对齐的滞后特征矩阵。当模型使用 ``lags`` 注册时，会以 ``lag_test=`` 传递给 "
"``train_fn``。"

#: 7656ab680cf544f2aa6075862bc1cd2e cfdf2d8012fb4be58bcdc934ee36069b of
