"``Mapping`` of :class:`pybroker.common.IndicatorSymbol` pairs to "
"``pandas.Series`` of :class:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator` values."
msgstr ""
"将 :class:`pybroker.common.IndicatorSymbol` 组合映射到 "
":class:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator` 值 ``pandas.Series`` 的 ``Mapping``。"

#: 988c471974454c468de01daae59ed4d6 of
#: pybroker.model.ModelsMixin.train_models:12
msgid "Date fields used to key cache data."
msgstr "用于为缓存数据生成键的日期字段。"

#: 54cb89c9225046fd8ce2542da3e568cc of
#: pybroker.model.ModelsMixin.train_models:13
msgid ""
"If ``True``, :class:`.ModelTrainer` models are trained in parallel using "
"multiple processes. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr "如果为 ``True``，:class:`.ModelTrainer` 模型会使用多个进程并行训练。默认为 ``False``。"

#: ce29a926401b49e49bf74fab9fa82a92 of
#: pybroker.model.ModelsMixin.train_models:16
msgid ""
"``Mapping`` of ``(model_name, execution_id)`` pairs to ``frozenset[str]``"
" of symbols for pooled training. Defaults to ``None``."
msgstr ""
"将 ``(model_name, execution_id)`` 组合映射到用于池化训练的品种 ``frozenset[str]`` 的 "
"``Mapping``。默认为 ``None``。"

#: c93d6fb30cbb400ab80908fcf1c6f075 of
#: pybroker.model.ModelsMixin.train_models:19
msgid ""
"Number of bars in the future of the target prediction, expressed in the "
"bars of the timeframe each model is fitted on: a model bound to an "
"interval holds out ``lookahead`` compressed bars between its train and "
"test rows. Defaults to ``1``."
msgstr ""
"预测目标未来的 K 线数量，以每个模型所拟合的时间框架的 K 线为单位：绑定到某个区间的模型，会在其训练行和测试行之间保留 "
"``lookahead`` 根压缩 K 线。默认为 ``1``。"

#: e8585aa6b00f4bd083a07e9dfcf918ba of
#: pybroker.model.ModelsMixin.train_models:25
msgid ""
"``dict`` mapping each :class:`pybroker.common.ModelSymbol` pair to a "
":class:`pybroker.common.TrainedModel`."
msgstr ""
"将每个 :class:`pybroker.common.ModelSymbol` 组合映射到 "
":class:`pybroker.common.TrainedModel` 的 ``dict``。"

#: 99333273bb2447aeada09c6dab83e78b of
#: pybroker.model.apply_lags_to_model_input:1
